#: ../../source/docs/common-airspeed-sensor.rst:6
#: 00b70287e73d4adb8ac31b483b89b8ce
msgid "Airspeed Sensor"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-airspeed-sensor.rst:8
#: bb9fb0304a3642d4a8d9b6c5905c6417
msgid "Copter, Rover, and Blimp can attach and enable an Airspeed Sensor. However, unlike Plane which uses the readings for navigation and control, these vehicles only log and report the readings for use by the displays in Ground Control Stations, OSDs, and telemetry. The Plane airspeed sensor :ref:`documentation<plane:airspeed>` can followed for selecting and mounting an airspeed sensor. However, be aware that it will not provide all the features discussed in Plane except for measurement and reporting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-airspeed-sensor.rst:10
#: 52c4e86650fc456a936f42a47e839344
msgid "The one exception to the above is that Sailboats can use an airspeed sensor as part of a :ref:`Wind Vane<rover:wind-vane>` (:ref:`WNDVN_TYPE<WNDVN_TYPE>` = 4) and use its readings to calculate wind speed as a part of navigation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-airspeed-sensor.rst:12
#: d4d76ee3559447b2ab2fcff29baea2a2
msgid "Set :ref:`ARSPD_ENABLE<ARSPD_ENABLE>` = 1 to allow use of airspeed sensor and to show other airspeed parameters"
msgstr ""

